+# Bootstrap: Trust (KMS, Cosign, Webhook) & Verifier Validation Runbook
+
+This runbook sequences the five high-priority tasks to reach trusted, auditable promotions and verifier gating.
+
+1) Provision KMS & Evidence bucket
+ - Run: ./terraform/bootstrap/run_terraform_and_create_secret.sh terraform/kms_and_s3 security
+ - Confirm outputs in /tmp/aegis_evidence_bucket.env
+
+2) Deploy cosign admission webhook with TLS
+ - Ensure cert-manager installed
+ - Run: ./ops/cosign/helm_deploy_and_populate_ca.yml
+ - Confirm ValidatingWebhookConfiguration caBundle populated
+
+3) Configure CI for cosign KMS signing
+ - Add GitHub secret COSIGN_AWS_KMS_KEY_ARN with the KMS ARN
+ - Use .github/workflows/cosign_kms_sign_template.yml as reusable workflow in CI jobs
+
+4) Run verifier full CI gate
+ - Trigger .github/workflows/verifier_full_ci.yml manually or via a PR
+ - Observe steps: finetune -> calibrate -> adversarial -> fairness -> validation -> sign -> SME signoff -> artifact upload
+
+5) Deploy shadow & long-run canaries
+ - Apply Argo CronWorkflow argo/cron_shadow_upload.yaml in ml-pipelines
+ - Watch monitoring (Prometheus/Grafana) for divergence alerts
+
+6) Kernel autotuner & validation
+ - Run jobs/kernel_autotuner/run_autotuner_and_validate.sh on representative GPU host(s)
+ - Confirm kernel-best-config ConfigMap is present and Triton uses new config
+
+7) Archive evidence & retention
+ - Confirm ops/s3/event_uploader.py or equivalent is pushing events to the evidence bucket
+ - Verify object retention metadata and legal signoff
+
+If any step fails, follow the incident runbooks in ops/runbooks/* and notify SRE + Security + ML Lead.
+
